Hi Justine,

The problem is that when reading the VCF file with the function read.vcfR, it doesn't set the ploidy automatically. So to set the ploidy of your genlight object use the following command:

> ploidy(MR.gl) <- 2

Please let us know whether this worked for you.

Cheers,
Luis

