Dear dartR users,

The dartR developer team is participating in a CSIRO program in which we are learning about how to engage with end users and stakeholders. This will help us to understand the challenges that our end-users might be facing from a different perspective.

So, we would appreciate if you could give us 10 minutes of your time to talk about your research area and the challenges that you face when analysing your data.

If you would like to help us in this regard, we could schedule an online meeting.

Cheers,
Luis

